      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hopper 上的新瓶颈",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hopper 上的新瓶颈",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "core-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85,
      "y": 205,
      "width": 508.3000000000003,
      "height": 255,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8086,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "v2 在 H100 上仍未吃满：\nTensor Core 更快后，数据搬运和 softmax 更容易挡路。\n\nHopper 给了三个关键能力：\nTMA：异步搬 tile 到 SMEM\nWGMMA：warpgroup 级 Tensor Core MMA\nFP8：更高吞吐，但要控制误差\n\nv3 的核心不是少算，而是异步流水：\nproducer 负责预取下一块 K/V\nconsumer 负责当前块 QK/softmax/PV\n两个 consumer warpgroup ping-pong，互相遮住 softmax 延迟",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "v2 在 H100 上仍未吃满：\nTensor Core 更快后，数据搬运和 softmax 更容易挡路。\n\nHopper 给了三个关键能力：\nTMA：异步搬 tile 到 SMEM\nWGMMA：warpgroup 级 Tensor Core MMA\nFP8：更高吞吐，但要控制误差\n\nv3 的核心不是少算，而是异步流水：\nproducer 负责预取下一块 K/V\nconsumer 负责当前块 QK/softmax/PV\n两个 consumer warpgroup ping-pong，互相遮住 softmax 延迟",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
